{'symbol': 'BEN', 'date': '2022-11-23 09:30:00', 'title': 'INDEPENDENT INSURANCE GROUP ANNOUNCES MILESTONE MARK OF $100 MILLION SOLD IN ISTRUCTURE--THE FIRST UNCAPPED INDEX-LINKED STRUCTURED SETTLEMENT ANNUITY LINKED TO THE FRANKLIN BOFA WORLD INDEX™', 'text': 'OVER $100 MILLION IN COMMITTED SALES TO DATE JACKSONVILLE, FLA., NOV. 23, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- INDEPENDENT INSURANCE GROUP, LLC ("INDEPENDENT GROUP") ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT ITS LIFE AND ANNUITY SUBSIDIARY, INDEPENDENT LIFE INSURANCE COMPANY ("INDEPENDENT LIFE") CROSSED THE MILESTONE MARK OF $100 MILLION IN COMMITTED SALES OF ISTRUCTURE, THE FIRST UNCAPPED INDEX-LINKED STRUCTURED SETTLEMENT ANNUITY.'}